        "Using NetworkX, create a directed weighted graph with 6 employee nodes. Edges represent emails with weights as email counts. Display the weighted adjacency matrix. Compute in-degree and out-degree for each node to find who sends and receives the most emails. Visualize with edge width proportional to weight.\n",
