        "<div style=\"border-left: 5px solid #4B2E83; background-color: #F9F7FC; padding: 20px 25px; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 5px;\">\n",
        "  <h3 style=\"color: #4B2E83;\">Example 8.2 &mdash; Network Visualization with Plotly</h3>\n",
        "  <p style=\"color:#555;\"><strong>Tool:</strong> Plotly creates interactive plots with hover, zoom, and pan built in.</p>\n",
        "</div>"
      ],
      "id": "ccb6412185122262"
